  _recipeBookDescriptionUnspoiled: "This dish is probably too good to be true. The
    smell of roasted fat intertwined with what is probably half the spice cabinet
    wafts through the air. The sauce on top makes it beautiful and glistening. It\u2019s
    hard to say what poor animal this delectable dish is made of...\n\nBetter not
    to think about it for too long. Just dig in! "
  _recipeBookDescriptionSpoiled: 'The juices squidging out of this thing oozes thickly
    down the ridges of cooked flesh. When you eat this, you can''t tell if it''s
    you or the wriggling meat that''s shuddering. Ignore the goosebumps, and it tastes
    great. Too great. '
